# Alpha-3 Exit Criteria

```yaml
header:
  id: ALPHA3_EXIT
  intent: GATE
  status: PENDING
  priority: CRITICAL
```

## CRD Gate Conditions
All following must PASS before Alpha-4:

```yaml
exit_criteria:
  gguf_loader:
    status: PENDING
    file: fem/hacedle/src/x/loader/gguf/loader_std.rs
    
  q4k:
    status: PENDING
    max_abs_error: < 1e-5
    reference: llama.cpp
    
  first_token:
    status: PENDING
    model: qwen2.5-0.5b.gguf
    prompt: "hello"
    output: token_id
    
  replay:
    status: PENDING
    golden_blocks: 24
    all_pass: true
    
  lro_attach:
    status: PENDING
    adapter_loading: true
    overlay_composition: true
```

## Do NOT Proceed to Alpha-4 Until All PASS

```yaml
blocked_until:
  - Aura Orch
  - Coge
  - Alliag
  - Zeus Dynamic
```

